            (*parser.Part)({
              Name: (string) "",
              Type: (string) (len=9) "paragraph",
              Value: (string) (len=294) "I like a big neck – thick, flat and wide. I lacquered the fingerboard with Rustin's Plastic Coating. The tremolo is interesting in that the arm's made from an old bicycle saddle bag carrier, the knob from the ends of a knitting needle, and the springs are valve springs from an old motorbike.",
